      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Developed by Peterson Companies in the early 2000s, National Harbor now hosts 150+ stores, restaurants, and attractions like Gaylord National Resort, MGM casino, and the 180‑foot Capital Wheel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
