      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area was part of the Oxon Hill tract, patented in the late 17th century, supporting plantation farming of tobacco and grains with enslaved labor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
